COPY_EXISTING ~#0HLA_1.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Epic Prowess~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Epic Prowess
The character's skill at combat grows, permanently granting them a +1 bonus to hit and damage.

This ability may be selected once.~

COPY_EXISTING ~#0HLA_2.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Armor Skin~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Armor Skin
The character's armor class vs. all weapon types permanently increases by 1.

This ability may be selected once.~

COPY_EXISTING ~#0HLA_3.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Epic Marksman~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Epic Marksman
The character permanently gains a +1 damage bonus on ranged attacks. Depending on the character's Dexterity, they gain a further +1 bonus at 19, 22 and 25 Dexterity respectively.

This ability may be selected once.

Requires: Epic Prowess, Proficiency in Crossbow, Longbow, Shortbow, Dart or Sling~

COPY_EXISTING ~#0HLA3X.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
LPF ALTER_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 326 parameter2 = prof_gteq_103 END
LPF CLONE_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 326 match_parameter2 = prof_gteq_103 parameter2 = prof_gteq_104 END
LPF CLONE_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 326 match_parameter2 = prof_gteq_103 parameter2 = prof_gteq_105 END
LPF CLONE_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 326 match_parameter2 = prof_gteq_103 parameter2 = prof_gteq_106 END
LPF CLONE_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 326 match_parameter2 = prof_gteq_103 parameter2 = prof_gteq_107 END

ACTION_FOR_EACH base_clab IN clabba01 clabdr01 clabfi01 clabmo01 clabpa01 clabpr01 clabrn01 clabth01 clabma01 clabso01 BEGIN
ACTION_IF FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~%base_clab%.2DA~ BEGIN
COPY_EXISTING ~%base_clab%.2DA~ OVERRIDE
  // Borrowed from Rogue Rebalancing
  REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~AP_#0HLA3X~ ~****      ~
        LPF set_clab_2da_entries INT_VAR f_MinLevel = 1 f_Increment = 1 STR_VAR f_Entry = AP_#0HLA3X END
  PRETTY_PRINT_2DA
END
END

COPY_EXISTING ~KITLIST.2DA~ ~override~
  READ_2DA_ENTRIES_NOW ~KITLIST~ 10
  FOR (row = 1; row < KITLIST; row += 1) BEGIN
  READ_2DA_ENTRY_FORMER ~KITLIST~ row 5 kit_clab
  READ_2DA_ENTRY_FORMER ~KITLIST~ row 1 kit_label
  READ_2DA_ENTRY_FORMER ~KITLIST~ row 8 kit_class
  
    PATCH_IF FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~%kit_clab%.2da~ BEGIN
      INNER_ACTION BEGIN
      COPY_EXISTING ~%kit_clab%.2DA~ override
        REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~AP_#0HLA3X~ ~****      ~
        LPF set_clab_2da_entries INT_VAR f_MinLevel = 1 f_Increment = 1 STR_VAR f_Entry = AP_#0HLA3X END
        PRETTY_PRINT_2DA
      END
  END
END

