SAY NAME1 ~Epic Weapon Focus I~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Epic Weapon Focus
The character may gain a proficiency point in any chosen weapon type. If a weapon that the character can not normally be wielded is chosen, they gain the ability to wield that weapon.

This ability may be selected up to three times, but may only be used once per weapon type.~

