SAY NAME1 ~Blinding Speed~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Blinding Speed
This ability allows the user to move and attack at extraordiary speed. For the next two turns, the user's movement rate is quadrupled, and their attacks per rounds are doubled as per an Improved Haste spell. As this effect is not truly magical in nature, it may not be dispelled as Improved Haste might.

This ability may be selected once. Upon selecting this ability, it may be used twice per day.~

COPY_EXISTING ~SPCL900.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Blinding Speed~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Blinding Speed
This ability allows the user to move and attack at extraordiary speed. For the next two turns, the user's movement rate is quadrupled, and their attacks per rounds are doubled as per an Improved Haste spell. As this effect is not truly magical in nature, it may not be dispelled as Improved Haste might.

This ability may be selected once. Upon selecting this ability, it may be used twice per day.~

COPY_EXISTING ~SPCL901.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Whirlwind Attack~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Whirlwind Attack
This ability allows the warrior to unleash a flurry of super-fast blows. For the duration, the user's THAC0 is penalized by 4 points and they may not make critical hits, but are Hasted for the duration and each attack made will roll to hit twice. The additional attack deals 50% reduced physical damage.

The Whirlwind Attack lasts for one round.

Requires: Blinding Speed~

COPY_EXISTING ~SPCL905.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Critical Strike~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Critical Strike
Upon using this ability, the warrior unleashes a chain of increasingly lethal strikes. For the next three successful melee attacks after landing this ability, the warrior immediately attacks again with an additional hit that will always critically strike. The second and third additional attacks deal 25% and 50% increased physical damage respectively, and the final attack always deals maximum damage.

Requires: Improved Critical~

