COPY_EXISTING ~SPCL906.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Sundering Strike~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Sundering Strike
This powerful two-strike technique allows warriors of great strength to break their opponent's guard and then inflict a debilitating attack. After this ability is used, the first melee attack made by the user Slows the target, reducing their Armor Class and THAC0 by 4, and reduces their physical resistances by a value equal to the user's Strength stat multiplied by 2 for three rounds. The second attack made afterwards has an increased melee damage modifier of 10 and Stuns the target for two rounds unless a Saving Throw vs. Death at -2 is made, with an additional -1 modifier per point of Strength above 18.

When Sundering Strike is used, the warrior may only make a maximum of two attacks per round until both attacks are made.~

