COPY_EXISTING ~#0CL907.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Hardiness~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Hardiness
Upon selecting this ability for the first time, the warrior permanently gains 10% resistance to all forms of physical damage.

When used as a special ability, the warrior calls upon hidden reserves of strength during times of danger, gaining 10% resistance to all physical damage plus 1% additional resistance for every 10 Maximum Hit Points they have at the time of casting, up to a maximum of 40% total at 300 Maximum Hit Points. The ability lasts for 1 round for every 2 levels of the warrior.

This ability does not stack with Defensive Stance.

Requires: Epic Toughness~

COPY_EXISTING ~SPCL907.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
