SAY NAME1 ~One Shot~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~One Shot
The user can attempt to deliver an extremely powerful ranged attack at the cost of any additional attacks made for the next round. This attack is a guaranteed critical hit and inflicts additional non-mitigated missile damage equal to double the user's level.

This ability may only be used once per turn.

Requires: Epic Marksman~
