COPY_EXISTING ~#0CL909.SPL~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME1 ~Last Stand~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Last Stand
The user gains a +150 temporary bonus to their maximum hit points for the next turn and immunity to all movement-impairing and mind-affecting effects. However, they may not receive healing from most sources while under the effects. When the duration ends, they lose the temporary hit points and take 150 points of non-lethal damage, knocking them unconscious if they would fall below one hit point.

Requires: Epic Toughness, Hardiness~